   CUSTOMER SUPPORT CENTER
   Post-commissioning dashboard: warranty, claims, maintenance, visits,
   issues, service history, report cards and embedded report data.

   Reads existing records only - no new transactional data is created.
   Everything is wrapped in an IIFE so its helpers cannot collide with the
   Work Stage dashboard script, which shares the Customer form.
   ========================================================================= */

(function () {

var EXPIRING_DEFAULT = 30;   // fallback if Support Settings has no value
var LIST_LIMIT = 10;         // rows shown per table before "View All"
var LEDGER_LIMIT = 20;       // ledger rows shown inline

frappe.ui.form.on("Customer", {
